- The project can be assembled in four variants: without mqtt client and without rest client, with mqtt but without rest, with rest but without mqtt, with rest and with mqtt
- Dependencies may include paho-mqtt and httpx in synchronous modes
- Created wrappers for clients should not be used directly in PepeunitClient; they must satisfy abstract classes from interfase.py
